# Docker build context for Dockerfile.server and Dockerfile.client.
# The images are PUBLIC (ghcr.io/kisaesdevlab/vibe-tb-*): anything that reaches
# a final stage is readable by anyone. The final stages copy only named build
# output, and this list keeps the rest out of the context altogether.
# Both Dockerfiles need: server/** (minus the below), client/**, deploy/.

.git
.github
.claude
.appliance
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
**/*.map

# Build output and runtime data from a local checkout
client/dist
server/dist
server/uploads
server/backups

# Tests (server tests would otherwise compile into dist/)
**/__tests__
test
specs

# Docs, plans and project notes
docs
installer
scripts
shared
# root-level only (a bare pattern matches the context root; server/knowledge/*.md is needed)
*.md
PHASES.md
STATE.md
QUESTIONS.md
docker-compose*.yml
setup.sh
setup.ps1
start.ps1
